+# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
+"""zh_TW (Traditional Chinese / Taiwan) extended translation source.
+
+Authored by the zh_TW translation agent. This module is the **only** file in
+the batch; no shared table, builder, locale asset, registry entry or test is
+touched here. The integration agent is expected to wire it into
+``tool/content/build_full_catalogs.py`` and then regenerate the catalogs.
+
+What lives here
+---------------
+Fields the current builder does not yet emit, because its tuple sources only
+carry ``name`` / ``shortName`` / ``description`` (or ``definition``):
+
+* ``PATICCAS_ZH_TW``  — four aspects + doctrinal note + examples (12 links)
+* ``PACCAYAS_ZH_TW``  — paccayaDhamma / paccayuppanna / subdivisions /
+                        examples / doctrinal note (24 conditions)
+* ``VITHIS_ZH_TW``    — arisingCondition / significance / doctrinal note /
+                        steps (4 processes)
+* ``KAMMAS_ZH_TW``    — doctrinal note + examples (16 kammas), plus the
+                        name/shortName corrections listed in
+                        ``KAMMA_NAME_CORRECTIONS_ZH_TW``
+
+Editing rules honoured
+----------------------
+* Every value is Traditional Chinese in Taiwan idiom, written from the English
+  reference + the Vietnamese source + the Pāḷi/``assets/data/*.json`` record.
+  Nothing is pasted through from English, Vietnamese or Simplified Chinese.
+* Canonical IDs, Pāḷi, formulas and numbers are preserved exactly.
+* Existing zh_TW work is preserved: the vithi steps already shipped for
+  ``VT_NGU_MON_RATLON`` are NOT repeated here (``STEPS`` only lists what is
+  missing), and no name/shortName/description already in the catalog is
+  overwritten except where ``KAMMA_NAME_CORRECTIONS_ZH_TW`` proves the shipped
+  value is attached to the wrong ID.
+* Absent fields stay absent. Nothing here is invented: where the source is
+  ambiguous the field is simply left out of the dict.
+
+Terminology anchor
+------------------
+Native Theravāda Chinese source used throughout (verified in context, not from
+a word list):
+
+    阿耨樓陀 (Ācariya Anuruddha) 造，葉均 譯，《攝阿毘達磨義論》
+    (Abhidhammatthasaṅgaha). 台灣繁體版：台北，大千出版社，2002 年 2 月，
+    ISBN 9789578231849，262 頁。（簡體版：中國佛教協會，1986 年。）
+
+Sections cited: 第三〈攝雜分別品〉（vithi 作用名相）、第四〈攝路分別品〉
+（五門／意門心路、極大境等四種境）、第八〈攝緣分別品〉（緣起法十二支、
+發趣法二十四緣之名目與分類）。
+
+Note: the glossary header in ``l10n_work/glossary.csv`` writes the title as
+「摂阿毘達磨義論」. 「摂」 is the Japanese shinjitai form of 「攝」 and is not
+a Traditional Chinese character; the correct Traditional/Taiwan form is
+「攝」 (《攝阿毘達磨義論》). Flagged, not silently changed — see the ledger.
+"""
